e psychological depths of trauma and fear. Will you uncover the truths binding these stories, or be consumed by the mysteries you seek to unravel?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >                                             <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/extras_big/e8b11e960761fe5e05348a98bc417971.avif?t=1771407256 width=800 height=45 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Evernoth is a psychological horror game where you explore mysterious locations filled with chilling secrets. Navigate distorted corridors, face terrifying monsters, and unlock new abilities as you unravel haunting mysteries across dark worlds.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Catalan<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/d5927fc7e6b27bb8cdf1740072e420179e7961b4/header.jpg?t=1771407256", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/1325b59921ce813e72b0daf0f7072b72af0ad182/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771407256", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265770/1325b59921ce813e72b0daf0f7072b72af0ad182/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771407256", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX2070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 